Q. What is Terraform with AWS (IaC Alternative)?
A:	Terraform is an open-source Infrastructure as Code (IaC) tool developed by HashiCorp, used to provision, manage, and automate cloud infrastructure.
 	It supports multiple cloud providers, including AWS, Azure, GCP, and more.
When used with AWS, Terraform acts as a powerful alternative to AWS CloudFormation.
Feature
Description
Multi-Cloud Support
Not limited to AWS — works with many providers
Declarative Syntax (HCL)
Use HashiCorp Configuration Language (HCL) to define infra
Idempotent
Only changes what needs to be changed
Modular and Reusable
Use modules to define reusable infrastructure blocks
Plan Before Apply
Preview changes before modifying real resources
State Management
Maintains infrastructure state for comparison & drift detection

